 ## Overview
-A dynamic Level-of-Detail (LOD) technique for volume rendering on unstructured grids that creates a progressive hierarchy of tetrahedra stored in a multi-triangulation data structure [S1, S2, unofficial]. It differs from static LOD methods by dynamically updating the mesh to achieve interactive frame rates, building on the bottom-up fusion principles of [Error-Based Model Generation (Bottom-Up Fusion)](1306-error-based-model-generation-bottom-up-fusion.md) by encoding all necessary simplification operations in advance.
